{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_045660","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Monos这个名字我还是第一次听说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"可能不像Bigfoot那么有名吧。它是生活在委内瑞拉的猿人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"体型倒没什么了不起，不到<R=2瓦拉,1.6m>，不过听说凶暴程度还在Bigfoot之上。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=2瓦拉,1.6m>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"到底有多凶暴呢？比如抓到动物后，一直揍到它死为止……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"杀死猎物再吃掉，是自然界的法则。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"可是，比起咬，用拳头猛揍看起来更凶暴吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"也许正因为它很像人类，才会让你有这种感觉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"……话说回来，你还真开心啊，Chico。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"果然，未知生物还是得凶暴点才行。不然猎人也没什么狩猎的成就感了！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""}]}